+/// Bounded retry policy for a publisher whose own publication dirties its
+/// inputs. Retrying once is not enough for a transient invalidation, and
+/// retrying forever monopolizes an idle task, so a spent round buys a short
+/// pause and a fresh round until the rounds run out.
